    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectFound? THEN\n\t\t\tDO MoveToObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO TakeObject\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectHeavy? THEN\n\t\t\tDO MoveToDestination\n\tELSE\n\t\tDO ProcessObjectProperties\n\t\tDO PerformSpecificTask\n\tEND\n"
